{
  "version": 1,
  "project": "wantai-dev/001-arcteryx-deals-platform",
  "runner": "ubuntu-latest",
  "install": [
    {
      "command": [
        "python3",
        "-m",
        "pip",
        "install",
        "-r",
        "requirements.txt"
      ],
      "cwd": "."
    },
    {
      "command": [
        "npm",
        "ci"
      ],
      "cwd": "app"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "python-unit",
      "paths": [
        "**/*.py",
        ".github/workflows/**",
        "requirements.txt"
      ],
      "command": [
        "python3",
        "-m",
        "unittest",
        "discover",
        "-s",
        "tests",
        "-v"
      ],
      "cwd": "."
    },
    {
      "id": "web-node-unit",
      "paths": [
        "tests/*.js",
        "web/**",
        "api/**",
        "*.js",
        "tools/*.mjs",
        "catalog/**"
      ],
      "command": [
        "node",
        "--test",
        "tests/test_artifact_revision.js",
        "tests/test_catalog_api.js",
        "tests/test_geo_product_endpoint.js",
        "tests/test_product_names.js",
        "tests/test_product_server.js",
        "tests/test_seo_index_policy.js",
        "tests/test_web_product_preview.js"
      ],
      "cwd": "."
    },
    {
      "id": "app-tests",
      "paths": [
        "app/**"
      ],
      "command": [
        "npm",
        "test"
      ],
      "cwd": "app"
    },
    {
      "id": "app-typecheck",
      "paths": [
        "app/**"
      ],
      "command": [
        "npm",
        "run",
        "typecheck"
      ],
      "cwd": "app"
    },
    {
      "id": "app-verify-config",
      "paths": [
        "app/**"
      ],
      "command": [
        "npm",
        "run",
        "verify:config"
      ],
      "cwd": "app"
    },
    {
      "id": "app-verify-release-assets",
      "paths": [
        "app/**"
      ],
      "command": [
        "npm",
        "run",
        "verify:release-assets"
      ],
      "cwd": "app"
    },
    {
      "id": "app-verify-store-metadata",
      "paths": [
        "app/**"
      ],
      "command": [
        "npm",
        "run",
        "verify:store-metadata"
      ],
      "cwd": "app"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Node.js22与Python3.13；根Python tests为原refresh-outlet生命周期验证所用unittest discover，JS测试显式列出当前全部tests/test_*.js。app使用现有npm scripts。",
    "app verify:local含live汇率、线上数据探针、Expo doctor下载与iOS导出清理，因此没有直接作为完整回归命令；只选它已有的隔离unit/typecheck/config/assets/store-metadata步骤。full不包括App Store、iOS构建/提交、截图视觉验收或真实汇率与生产数据新鲜度。",
    "10份现有业务workflow（采集、刷新、价格审计、GEO/新鲜度监控与诊断）字节保持；不更改schedule，不以它们充作回归。manifest不启动采集、Supabase同步、通知、IndexNow、在线修复或任何真实写入。",
    "当前清单仅在无生产凭证的隔离checkout执行；完整测试的网络mock/本地HTTP夹具不证明真实源站和生产可用性。"
  ]
}
